From 3c1f9002f84b91f9249cab47cfb91860cdf318ff Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 00:46:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Migrate to Android (Capacitor) with local SQLite

- Replace Supabase with src/lib/db: Supabase-style query builder over SQLite,
  versioned migrations, atomic backup/restore (26 tests on real SQLite)
- Remove auth, App Lock (PIN), PWA/service worker, offline blocking
- Replace Web Push with local notifications for calendar events
- Weather becomes opt-in; Android Auto Backup disabled
- Add Capacitor Android project, launcher icons, release signing via env,
  GitHub Actions workflow to build APK
- Rewrite README, add docs/VISION.md
