-## 🛠 Tech Stack
-
-- **Frontend**: React 18, TypeScript, Vite
-- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS v4
-- **Backend**: Supabase (PostgreSQL, Auth, Row Level Security, Edge Functions)
-- **Charts**: Recharts
-- **Calendar**: react-big-calendar
-- **PWA**: vite-plugin-pwa (Workbox)
-- **Hosting**: Vercel
-
